* ik: bucket grid (OBJPOS_interference_kernels.md 2): die 1 lowered 5 (bottom z=10) into workpiece 2, mode 102 along -z. Grid over the die surface 8x10x11, z cells 3.64 high from z=10; the die bottom (cell 0) is a candidate for the workpiece side nodes at z=11 (h=-1) but not for the top nodes at z=15 (cell 1). Expect d=-1: die 1 moved by (0,0,1), bottom ends at z=11 (a brute-force face search would give z=15); 'Object 1 has been interference positioned w.r.t. Object 2.'
